# Kept on this machine, not in the repository.
#
# migration/ carries the shop's old exports — 197 clients and 201 drivers by
# name, phone, card number and address — plus a dump of the live tables. A git
# history is forever and is read by anyone ever given the repo, so none of that
# goes in. The one-off scripts that reset and repaired data during setup stay
# with it; they are dated to a moment, not part of the service.
migration/
scripts/*.js

